  "question": {
    "text": "A thermodynamic cycle <math><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi></math> is shown on a <math><mi>V</mi></math> - <math><mi>T</mi></math> diagram.<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/d1b1b24f-3b2d-4c64-8e65-2b661e144542-image.png\" style=\"width: 197px; height: 191px;\" /><br />The <math><mi>P</mi></math> - <math><mi>V</mi></math> diagram that best describes this cycle is: (Diagrams are schematic and not to scale)",
    "image": null
  },
